Description: Performs Genome-Wide Association Study (GWAS) analysis using 
    Expectation-Maximization Bayesian Adaptive LASSO with Variational Inference (emBALVI).
    Includes genotype preprocessing, genomic relationship matrix construction,
    GWAS analysis, Manhattan and QQ plotting.s.
